%% title: AML Alert (Case) Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN: LOW / MEDIUM risk case created
  [*] --> UNDER_REVIEW: HIGH / CRITICAL risk case created

  OPEN --> UNDER_REVIEW: analyst picks up case
  OPEN --> ESCALATED: immediate escalation
  OPEN --> CLEARED: analyst decision — no issue found
  OPEN --> BLOCKED: analyst decision — confirmed match

  UNDER_REVIEW --> ESCALATED: MLRO escalation required
  UNDER_REVIEW --> CLEARED: analyst decision (decidedBy mandatory)
  UNDER_REVIEW --> BLOCKED: analyst decision (decisionReason mandatory)

  ESCALATED --> UNDER_REVIEW: escalation resolved, back to review
  ESCALATED --> CLEARED: MLRO clears (false positive / resolved)
  ESCALATED --> BLOCKED: MLRO confirms (SAR filed)

  CLEARED --> [*]: terminal — emits aml.case.status_changed.v1 (CLEARED)\nparty-service: amlStatus=CLEARED
  BLOCKED --> [*]: terminal — emits aml.case.status_changed.v1 (BLOCKED)\nparty-service: amlStatus=BLOCKED → party SUSPENDED

  note right of OPEN
    screening_type: CUSTOMER_ONBOARDING /
    TRANSACTION_MONITORING /
    PERIODIC_REVIEW / MANUAL_INVESTIGATION
  end note

  note right of BLOCKED
    decisionReason required.
    sar_filed + sar_reference recorded
    if SAR submitted to FIU.
  end note
